# Keep the Docker build context small and prevent secrets/artifacts from entering images.
# node_modules are installed fresh inside the image from the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vitest

# env + secrets — NEVER bake into an image (Railway injects env at runtime)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# vcs + tooling
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store

# tests / e2e / docs not needed at build
e2e
playwright-report
test-results
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.integration.spec.ts
documentation
spec
openspec
prototypes

# Infrastructure — never needed to build an app image. Critically, `.terraform/` holds
# downloaded provider plugins (~220MB *per environment directory*), so without this the
# build context balloons to ~450MB and every `az acr build` uploads Terraform binaries to
# Azure before it can start.
infra
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan

# local-only
docker-compose.yml
*.md
